{"sections":[{"slug":"泛包络代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"泛包络代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span> (Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"泛包络代数 (Lie 代数)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的泛包络代数</span> $U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模等同于</span> $U\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数的泛包络代数是一般</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴上的代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的泛包络代数的特例</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/泛包络代数(算畴)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">以下假设所讨论的</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数是有限维的</span>.</p>\n<p>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的泛包络代数</span> (universal enveloping algebra) <span lang=\"zh\">可定义为</span>\n$$\r\nU\\mathfrak g = T\\mathfrak g\\Big/ \\left&lt;xy-yx-[x,y]\\right&gt;.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的中心记为</span> $Z\\mathfrak g$, <span lang=\"zh\">它同构于</span> $\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">上多项式函数在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Weyl群","text":"Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/不变子空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">不变多项式</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak h^*]^W$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的所有左理想和有理想都是有限生成的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即同时有左右</span> Noether <span lang=\"zh\">性</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hopf代数","text":"Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模范畴是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">关联分次代数</span></h3>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/关联分次代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">关联分次代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{gr}U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">是交换代数</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> (Poincaré–Birkhoff–Witt)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $T\\mathfrak g\\to U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导了同构</span> $\\operatorname{Sym}\\mathfrak g\\to \\operatorname{gr}U\\mathfrak g$, <span lang=\"zh\">且对</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的任意一组基</span> $x_1,\\cdots,x_n$, $U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一组基</span>\n$$\r\n\\{x_1^{m_1}\\cdots x_n^{m_n}: m_i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">中心</span></h3>\n<h4>Harish–Chandra <span lang=\"zh\">同构</span></h4>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的中心</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为代数</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\nZ(U\\mathfrak g) \\simeq \\operatorname{Sym}(\\mathfrak h)^W.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">量子化</span></h3>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">可视为</span> $\\operatorname{Sym}\\mathfrak g\\simeq \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak g^*]$ <span lang=\"zh\">的形变量子化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而其中心</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">总是</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">不变的</span>” $Z(U\\mathfrak g)\\simeq \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak h^*]^W \\simeq \\mathbb{C}[\\mathfrak g^*]^G$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的作用保持滤过</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对短正合列</span>\n$$\r\n0 \\to F^{i-1}U\\mathfrak g \\to F^i U\\mathfrak g \\to \\operatorname{Sym}^i\\mathfrak g \\to 0\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">用</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">不变函子</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">在有限维</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示范畴上正合</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">我们得到</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{gr}Z(\\mathfrak g)\\simeq (\\operatorname{Sym}^i\\mathfrak g)^G\\simeq (\\operatorname{Sym}^i\\mathfrak h)^W.\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">后一个同构是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Chevalley同构","text":"Chevalley <span lang=\"zh\">同构</span>"}},{"Plain":".)</p>\n"}]}}}]}